WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.018 --> 00:00:02.940
-[Caine]: On the next episode
of "The Amazing Digital Circus,"

00:00:02.964 --> 00:00:04.390
everyone gets guns!

00:00:04.414 --> 00:00:06.033
That's really all there is to it!

00:00:06.057 --> 00:00:08.519
[laughing raucously]

00:00:08.543 --> 00:00:10.252
It's the showdown
of the century!

00:00:10.277 --> 00:00:11.465
Century! CENTURY!

00:00:11.490 --> 00:00:14.639
Three teams face off in a non-stop,
action-filled hootenanny

00:00:14.664 --> 00:00:15.865
that you won't want to miss!

00:00:15.889 --> 00:00:17.624
-[Jax]: I've been waiting for this
my whole life!

00:00:17.649 --> 00:00:19.807
-[Gangle]: Caine, I don't think
this is a good idea.

00:00:19.837 --> 00:00:22.496
-[Ragatha]: Yeah, I'm not sure this is
really what we need right now.

00:00:22.520 --> 00:00:23.503
[blam!]
[air whistling]

00:00:24.543 --> 00:00:26.529
-[Caine]: Only one team
will come out victorious

00:00:26.553 --> 00:00:28.193
in our longest episode yet!

00:00:28.217 --> 00:00:30.591
Over 33 minutes?
Holy moly!

00:00:30.615 --> 00:00:32.196
You couldn't cut that
down at all?!

00:00:32.220 --> 00:00:33.358
-[Gooseworx]:
Making shows is really hard

00:00:33.382 --> 00:00:34.818
when you have a cast this big.

00:00:34.842 --> 00:00:35.834
-[Kinger]: Wait, who was that?

00:00:35.858 --> 00:00:37.727
-[Mr. Gun]: Who am I?
I'm Mr. Gun!

00:00:37.751 --> 00:00:39.691
-[Kinger]: Not you, Mr. Gun.
The other voice.

00:00:39.715 --> 00:00:41.686
-[Zooble]: Uh, mister who?

00:00:41.710 --> 00:00:43.331
-[Mr. Gun]: I was supposed
to be in this episode,

00:00:43.355 --> 00:00:45.201
but Caine removed me
for being too gun!

00:00:45.225 --> 00:00:46.605
-[Zooble]:
Yeah, okay, whatever.

00:00:46.629 --> 00:00:49.011
-[Pomni]: Are we just all
in this trailer?

00:00:49.035 --> 00:00:50.504
-[Ep. 3 Trailer Narrator]:
And I'm still here, too --

00:00:50.528 --> 00:00:52.310
the Episode 3 trailer narrator.

00:00:52.334 --> 00:00:54.538
-[Ragatha]: Why do these trailers
have their own continuity?

00:00:54.562 --> 00:00:55.845
-[Caine]:
So, what are you waiting for?

00:00:55.869 --> 00:00:58.790
Buy your tickets today
and come down to the biggest event

00:00:58.814 --> 00:01:00.832
in Digital Circus history!

00:01:00.856 --> 00:01:01.426
-[Info Narrator]:
Tickets not really for sale.

00:01:01.450 --> 00:01:02.488
You can watch the latest episode
and all previous episodes

00:01:02.513 --> 00:01:03.715
of "The Amazing Digital Circus"
anytime at home or on the go

00:01:03.740 --> 00:01:04.388
on your computer book or device.

00:01:04.412 --> 00:01:05.239
If you have any
further questions or concerns,

00:01:05.264 --> 00:01:07.173
dial 8888888888888888888888881.

00:01:07.198 --> 00:01:07.986
Ask your parent's permission
before going to hell.

00:01:08.011 --> 00:01:10.391
-[Caine]: Be there or be rere!

00:01:11.877 --> 00:01:14.962
[sighs]
I wish guns were real.

